abstract: "Structures, physical chemistry and formulation arithmetic built on the Stepan personal-care seminar decks: 164 slides recorded, 40 charts rebuilt from the geometry of the slides, 34 formulas transcribed with their pages, and 27 surfactant structures, in marimo notebooks that run in the browser."
